    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hossam Sharawi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An archaeologist devastated by the loss of his lover, embarks on a daring quest into forbidden pyramids and ancient temples of Egypt. Armed with the Book of the Dead, he must summon powerful Egyptian gods and face them to navigate the risky journey through the afterlife. To bring back his lost lover, he needs to outwit and overcome these gods, each guarding a different tomb. Some gods are obstacles, seeking to hinder his progress, while others offer aid. Hossam\u2019s ultimate goal is to reach the Field of Reeds, retrieve his lost love, and escape back to the land of the living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGYPTIAN MYTHOLOGY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Ancient Egypt\u2019s Book of the Dead, immerse yourself and embark on a journey through the afterlife and encounter the many gods and goddesses in Egyptian mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself and explore the atmospheric environments in Revenant. Each level consists of puzzles that need to be completed to further progress through the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOULS-LIKE COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock onto enemies, dodge their attacks, and utilize the abilities granted to you by the gods to fight your way through the servants of the dead in the afterlife.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hossam Sharawi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An archaeologist devastated by the loss of his lover, embarks on a daring quest into forbidden pyramids and ancient temples of Egypt. Armed with the Book of the Dead, he must summon powerful Egyptian gods and face them to navigate the risky journey through the afterlife. To bring back his lost lover, he needs to outwit and overcome these gods, each guarding a different tomb. Some gods are obstacles, seeking to hinder his progress, while others offer aid. Hossam\u2019s ultimate goal is to reach the Field of Reeds, retrieve his lost love, and escape back to the land of the living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGYPTIAN MYTHOLOGY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Ancient Egypt\u2019s Book of the Dead, immerse yourself and embark on a journey through the afterlife and encounter the many gods and goddesses in Egyptian mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself and explore the atmospheric environments in Revenant. Each level consists of puzzles that need to be completed to further progress through the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOULS-LIKE COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock onto enemies, dodge their attacks, and utilize the abilities granted to you by the gods to fight your way through the servants of the dead in the afterlife.</p>",
